│ "Contraception for adolescents", "abstract": "A working knowledge of contraception will assist the pediatrician in   │
│ both sexual health promotion as well as treatment of common adolescent gynecologic problems. Best practices in       │
│ adolescent anticipatory guidance and screening include a sexual health history, screening for pregnancy and sexually │
