scores for the immediate post-insertion period (MD: 2.83; 95% CI: - 0.79, 6.45) and it caused various side effects.     
CONCLUSION Paracervical administration of lidocaine prior to IUD insertion reduces VAS pain scores. In view of the small
number of studies assessing its efficacy further studies should confirm our findings."                                  
