            "title": "Intrauterine techniques: contentious or consensus opinion?",                                      
            "abstract": "CONTEXT Insertion of intrauterine devices (IUDs) is a routine procedure in Contraception &     
Sexual Health (C&SH) Service clinics. Techniques for IUD insertion vary between practitioners. OBJECTIVE To describe the
preferred approach to various aspects of IUD provision of experienced doctors working in three large, teaching C&SH     
